msgid "Query Parameters"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The easiest way to specify a query parameter is to annotate a client method "
"parameter with the `@QueryParam` or the `@RestQuery`.\n"
"The `@RestQuery` is equivalent of the `@QueryParam`, but with optional name. "
"Additionally, it can be also used to pass query parameters\n"
"as a `Map`, which is convenient if parameters are not known in advance."
